rred.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/file enters process_file.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1546,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The request principal is supplied through the verified-user dependency, and non-admin file retrieval is constrained by the principal's user identifier.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1546,"endLine":1562}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The collection name is taken from the submitted form and, when supplied, remains the caller-selected destination passed to the write operation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1540,"endLine":1544},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1564,"endLine":1569},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1694,"endLine":1705}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible target-specific authorization control distinguishes administrators from non-administrators only when retrieving the source file; the non-admin path uses the file identifier and user identifier, with no visible destination collection ownership or write-grant check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"When a collection name is supplied, the handler follows the existing-collection processing path and uses the caller-selected collection rather than deriving only the file's own collection.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1565,"endLine":1569},{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1595,"endLine":1626}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The helper inserts the generated items into the named vector-database collection; this is the destination knowledge-base write sink.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1527,"endLine":1534}]},{"id":"f-file-ownership-distinction"